GLib on Darwin has no GDesktopAppInfo, so giomm has no Gio::DesktopAppInfo,
which the icon loader (taskbar, Hyprland workspace icons) is built on. Adds
include/util/desktop_app_info.hpp: the real headers elsewhere; on Darwin a
stand-in class reading Name, Icon and StartupWMClass from the desktop entry with
Glib::KeyFile, and a g_desktop_app_info_search() that finds nothing (icons are
found by exact desktop file name only).

